OL,3,ATrump calls off livestream of Fort Hood
OL,4,Aattacker's execution by firing squad
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think streaming the execution for
OL,7,Fall to see might have been a strong
OL,8,Fdeterrent for the World to witness how
OL,9,FAmerica deals with Terrorists and SCUM
OL,10,Flike Hasan," Trump said.
